  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the artful splendor of Sixth Element Tattoo, where master tattooist Pavel Kaloyanov brings visions to life with his expert neotraditional touch. Nestled in the historic heart of Veliko Tarnovo at 8 Stefan Stambolov Street, this studio is a sanctuary of creativity that fuses modern flair with timeless technique. Contact them at +359877389811 or sixthelementvt@gmail.com to etch your own piece of tradition into your skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\n@sixth_element_tattoo \n8 Stefan Stambolov str, Veliko Tarnovo, Bulgaria\nВелико Търново, ул. Стефан Стамболов 8\n+359877389811\nsixthelementvt@gmail.com\n\n@sixth_element_tattoo \n8 Stefan Stambolov str, Veliko Tarnovo, Bulgaria\nВелико Търново, ул. Стефан Стамболов 8\n+359877389811\nsixthelementvt@gmail.com",
